---
---
<section class="bg-warm-white px-6 py-28 md:py-36">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[760px]">
    <div class="fade-in-up mb-16 text-center">
      <p class="mb-5 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-gold">
        Selection Criteria
      </p>
      <h2
        class="font-serif font-normal leading-tight"
        style="font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em;"
      >
        Not for everyone. By design.
      </h2>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-[620px] font-light text-muted" style="line-height: 1.75;">
        We say no more than we say yes. Not because we enjoy it — but because the value of this community depends on the quality of every person in it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="fade-in-up mb-8 text-center">
      <p class="mb-12 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-muted">
        We look for:
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-12">
      <div class="fade-in-up text-center">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal" style="letter-spacing: -0.01em;">
          Substance over status
        </h3>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-[520px] font-light text-muted" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          We don't care where you went to school. We care that you're building a life with intention.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mx-auto h-px w-16 bg-divider"></div>

      <div class="fade-in-up text-center">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal" style="letter-spacing: -0.01em;">
          Emotional intelligence
        </h3>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-[520px] font-light text-muted" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          Can you hold a conversation? Read a room? Be kind to a stranger? That matters here.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="mx-auto h-px w-16 bg-divider"></div>

      <div class="fade-in-up text-center">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-charcoal" style="letter-spacing: -0.01em;">
          Genuine openness
        </h3>
        <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-[520px] font-light text-muted" style="line-height: 1.75;">
          If you're here to collect options, this isn't your club. If you're here to find something real, welcome.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
